[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6301.87, "timestamp": "01:45:01", "text": "不要让整个谈话都围绕这个主题展开。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6304.95, "timestamp": "01:45:04", "text": "动漫之类的东西。你可以直接带过来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6306.629, "timestamp": "01:45:06", "text": "退出对话，但不要太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6309.109, "timestamp": "01:45:09", "text": "我的天哪，我看到一些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6312.07, "timestamp": "01:45:12", "text": "就像在一些动漫活动中一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6316.149, "timestamp": "01:45:16", "text": "很像动漫，他们开始就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6318.149, "timestamp": "01:45:18", "text": "有些人喜欢动漫之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6321.59, "timestamp": "01:45:21", "text": "他们不喜欢那样做，而且我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6323.59, "timestamp": "01:45:23", "text": "人们也不应该这样做，因为就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6325.109, "timestamp": "01:45:25", "text": "他们并不瞧不起它，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6328.39, "timestamp": "01:45:28", "text": "就像动漫文化非常热衷于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6331.99, "timestamp": "01:45:31", "text": "他们的市场就像你会看到的动画一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6333.91, "timestamp": "01:45:33", "text": "广告无处不在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6335.59, "timestamp": "01:45:35", "text": "日本动画片。一切都将由他们创造。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6338.229, "timestamp": "01:45:38", "text": "所有动漫相关的东西。所以并非如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6340.95, "timestamp": "01:45:40", "text": "被人瞧不起。更像是如果你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6344.43, "timestamp": "01:45:44", "text": "炫耀过度就是他们尝试的时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6347.91, "timestamp": "01:45:47", "text": "打赌看他们看起来会是什么样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6350.39, "timestamp": "01:45:50", "text": "对着你。嗯？然后如果你穿得像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6352.39, "timestamp": "01:45:52", "text": "就像cosplay服装一样，然后你就走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6353.91, "timestamp": "01:45:53", "text": "显然，在地铁附近，人们会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6354.91, "timestamp": "01:45:54", "text": "是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6357.59, 